WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I want to tell you more

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,200
But that will completely destroy Brother Gu as a person

3
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,360
I'm going to find him

4
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,870
Boss, not now, boss

5
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,790
Heroes have long had iron rules

6
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:28,390
Wu Sheng is not allowed to interfere in Jianghu affairs

7
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:32,660
Give up your cultivation and get out of the way of the boss

8
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,780
You went on a killing spree in Liusu City

9
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,020
Already committed it once

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:39,140
So what if you do it again, boss?

11
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,230
The old general is upright and will not be hungry, he will only accept death.

12
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:43,910
I guaranteed you last time

13
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:48,570
He broke a leg and said that this time he would be in Yunjiang

14
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:51,530
Don’t forget the purpose of our trip. If we don’t go back soon,

15
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:55,050
More brothers will die in the Northern Territory, saying that the fall of the Northern Territory will be difficult.

16
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:56,970
Want me to look at my own brother

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:00:59,130
To face the pursuit of half the world alone
